<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Global Chinese Youth Mental Health Association</title>
  <style>
    /* Color Palette */
    :root {
      --primary-blue: #3b82f6;   /* Calm blue */
      --secondary-yellow: #facc15; /* Friendly yellow */
      --light-blue: #e0f2fe;
      --dark-blue: #1e40af;
      --text-dark: #1f2937;
      --text-light: #f9fafb;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--light-blue);
      color: var(--text-dark);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--primary-blue);
      color: var(--text-light);
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 1rem;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--secondary-yellow);
    }

    .hero {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--primary-blue), var(--dark-blue));
      color: var(--text-light);
    }

    .hero img {
      max-width: 250px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .cta-btn {
      background: var(--secondary-yellow);
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta-btn:hover {
      background: #fcd34d;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .section {
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section h3 {
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .grid-2 {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .grid-3 {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--dark-blue);
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>GCYMHA</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
      <a href="#mission">Mission</a>
      <a href="#join">Join</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <!-- Replace this with a hero image or logo -->
    <img src="your-hero-image.png" alt="GCYMHA Logo / Hero">
    <h2>Global Chinese Youth Mental Health Association</h2>
    <p>Supporting future leaders of psychological sciences and spreading mental health awareness across communities worldwide.</p>
    <button class="cta-btn">Join Us Today</button>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section">
    <h3>About Us</h3>
    <p>
      GCYMHA aims to spread mental health awareness globally by supporting future leaders of psychological sciences. 
      We provide mentorship and resources at no cost to passionate high school students who want to create psychology societies, 
      learn about psychological sciences, and design academic or career goals in the mental health industry.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="programs" class="section">
    <h3>What We Do</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Resource Sharing</h4>
        <p>We share mental health resources to at-risk ethnic groups and underserved populations both in person and online.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Breaking Barriers</h4>
        <p>We tear down the cultural barriers of mental illness stigma with personal narratives and open discussions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Education & Mentorship</h4>
        <p>We provide psychoeducation, career planning, and mentorship to students from junior high onward.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mission" class="section">
    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
    <p>
      Our student-run, internationally based team organizes local events, provides online workshops, disseminates 
      mental health content, and supports high school student psychology clubs on a regular basis. Together, we spread 
      awareness and support others kindly by simply helping out.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="join" class="section">
    <h3>Get Involved</h3>
    <p style="text-align: center;">
      Whether you are a student, parent, or community member, you can make an impact. 
      Join us in spreading mental health awareness and supporting future leaders in the field of psychology.
    </p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <button class="cta-btn">Become a Member</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Global Chinese Youth Mental Health Association. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
